The data files in this directory — institutions.json, not_classified.json,
agreement.json, transitions.jsonl, stage_definitions.json, translations.json,
summaries.json, homepages.json, feed.json and seen_urls.json — are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt this corpus for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether
changes were made.

If you use the corpus, please keep the assessed-but-not-classified appendix
(not_classified.json) with it. The negative record is what makes the positive
record readable as a rate rather than a highlight reel.

